  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「ごめんねぇ、転校生くん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「お姫さま抱っこで、運んでもらっちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「こんなところ、ちかちゃんに見られたらヤキモチやかれちゃうかなって！　きゃっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「でも、このへん岩盤とか剥きだしだもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「ふつうに歩いたらせっかくのドレスが汚れちゃうかもだし、もうちょっと我慢してね～？　良い子、良い子♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「にゅふふ。近くから見ると、あんずちゃんに『そっくり』かなって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「えっ、血は繋がってないの？　やぁん、義理の姉弟とか浪漫ちっくぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「……きみのことは、あんまり厄介ごとに巻きこみたくなかったんだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「あんずちゃんのことは巻きこんじゃって、とっても不幸な結果になっちゃったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「今さら言っても、後の祭りかなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「ちかちゃんは、きみのことお気に入りみたいだし。もう他人のふりもできないもんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「せめて、なるべく迷惑かけないようにがんばるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「むしろ、困ったことがあったらどんどん頼ってね！　あんずちゃんのぶんまで恩返しするから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「おね～さんに、まっかせなっさい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「保健室のベッドとか勝手に拝借してね～、お花とかで飾っちゃって～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「おっと。ここでいいよ、やこちゃんが寝床を整えてくれてるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「そぉっと、おろして？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「うん、上手上手……さすがは『ヘルプマン』だねぇ、介護者（ヘルパー）さん顔負け！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/normal/970"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「見て見て！　こうして寝転んだら、『眠り姫』の完成かなって☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「でも、まだチュウはしちゃ駄目～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「わたし『宣伝活動』が一区切りするまでは、目覚めちゃいけないって言われてるのぉ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「あれっ、やこちゃんから何も聞いてないの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「よくわかんないのに手伝ってくれてたんだね……、お人好しすぎるのも考えものかなって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「んっとね。明日、わたしたち演劇部の舞台があるんだよぉ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「題材は『眠り姫』なんだけど、ちょっと今年はクジ運が悪くて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「舞台の場所とか時間とか、あんまり良くないの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「他におおきなイベントがあったりする、びみょうな時刻でね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「だから、たくさん『宣伝活動』するつもりかなって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「文化祭は演劇部の晴れ舞台だもん、せっかくだからお客さんにいっぱいきてほしいしね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「それでね、四月ごろに『暗黒文化祭』ってあったでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「あれでいちばん盛りあがったイベントに、『クー・カロアを捕まえろ！』っていうのがあったじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「そうそう、二年生のクーちゃんって子をみんなで追いかけ回したやつ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「それを参考にしたイベント、『宣伝活動』を企画したのね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「内容はほとんど同じで、みんなで君咲学院じゅうを駆け回る感じ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「ルールは単純かなって。イベントに参加したい子は、まず演劇部部室でドレスに着替えるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「お金とかいらなくて、誰でもかわいいドレスが着られるんだよぉ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「舞踏会のときに、美術部の三波さんが大量につくってくれたドレスがあるからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「それに着替えてもらうの、もちろん着付けとかは演劇部で手伝うけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「わたしの趣味で、過去の演劇でつかったドレスもいっぱいあるしね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「足りなくなることはないかなって、きっと際限なく『お姫さま』が増殖しちゃう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「そうして着替えて『お姫さま』になった子には、あとは自由に文化祭を楽しんでもらうの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「校内を歩き回ってもらうの、難しいこと一切なし！　気楽に参加できちゃう～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「まぁ、気が向いたら宣伝用のビラとかも配ってもらうけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「かわいいドレスを着た子がどんどん増えていったら、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「みんな『ん？　何だろう？』って興味をもってくれるでしょ？　そういう、『宣伝活動』なの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「配られたビラを見てもらえたら、そのうち何割かは明日の舞台に足を運んでくれるかもだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「そしたら、あとはわたしたち演劇部がぐっとハートを掴むだけ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「それだけじゃイベントとして退屈だからって、やこちゃんが何か盛りあげる方法を考えてるみたいだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「わたしは、あんまり詳しく聞いてないなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「『ちづるは何も考えずに寝てればいいから』って、やこちゃん言ってたの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「きっと徹夜つづきのわたしを気遣ってくれたんだよぉ、やこちゃんはごくたまに優しいの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-princess",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「実際、すごぉい眠たいよぉ……わっ、ひ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「な、何？　耳が痛ぁい、目覚まし時計みたいなのが鳴ってない？」"
  },
  {
